id: long-press-image
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: Hold on an image (Wikipedia's infobox picture): the daemon sees the hold and the card's menu comes up over the page
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad
kit: cavekit-ui-shell.md R7
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:.infobox img' 60
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
sample page 0,100,756,900
hold-on 'sel:.infobox img'
wait differs 0,100,756,900 page 5
shoot hold-image
